  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "さあ。Cafe Paradeのステージを、\n心行くまで楽しんでいってくれ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "神谷 幸広"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_i:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 79,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "みんなが楽しんでくれたら、\nあたしたちはもっともーっと楽しくなっちゃうよ♪",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "水嶋 咲"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_i:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 79,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふふっ、素敵なスマイルありがとうございます。\nあなたの笑顔が、俺たちの力になります！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "卯月 巻緒"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_i:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 79,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "みなさん盛り上がっているようで、何よりです。\nもちろん、私自身も楽しんでいますよ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "東雲 荘一郎"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_i:step-13:text",
        "step_id": 13,
        "step_index": 12,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 79,
          "target_step_index": 12
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "うむ、漲る、漲るぞ！　汝らのその恍惚とした双眸が\n我が魔力を増幅させているぞ！　フハハハハ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "アスラン=BBⅡ世"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_i:step-16:text",
        "step_id": 16,
        "step_index": 15,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 79,
          "target_step_index": 15
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いっくよー！　俺たちから、目を離さないで！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "秋山 隼人"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_i:step-21:text",
        "step_id": 21,
        "step_index": 20,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_001_10_i",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_001_10_i.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 79,
          "target_step_index": 20
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "まだまだ！　会場中を盛り上げていくぜ！\nオレたちについてこーい！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "若里 春名"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_001_10_i:step-24:text",
